---
description: CLI should not contain defaults; defaults belong in workflow init/state.
alwaysApply: false
---
Do not put default values in `pr_creator/cli.py` (e.g. argparse `default=...` or other implicit fallbacks).

Defaults should be resolved in:
- The orchestrator init step (e.g. `pr_creator/workflows/orchestrator/init_step/node.py`), and/or
- The workflow state dataclasses (e.g. `pr_creator/workflows/orchestrator/state.py`)

This keeps the CLI as a thin input layer and makes defaults consistent for all callers.
